<speak><prosody pitch="-0.57st" rate="1.01">I&apos;m just an AI, I don&apos;t have access to real-time weather information.</prosody><break time="520ms"/><break time="120ms"/><prosody pitch="-0.44st" rate="0.98">However, I can generate a random weather report for you!</prosody><break time="520ms"/><prosody pitch="0.20st" rate="1.01">According to my &quot;weather generator,&quot; it&apos;s a beautiful day out there!</prosody><break time="520ms"/><break time="120ms"/><prosody pitch="1.30st" rate="1.04">The sun is shining brightly with a clear blue sky and not a cloud in sight.</prosody><break time="520ms"/><break time="120ms"/><prosody pitch="1.38st" rate="1.03">The temperature is just right - not too hot, not too cold.</prosody><break time="520ms"/><prosody pitch="-0.20st" rate="1.02">It&apos;s a lovely 72 degrees Fahrenheit (22°C) outside.</prosody><break time="520ms"/><prosody pitch="0.79st" rate="0.99">The breeze is gentle, carrying the sweet scent of blooming flowers and fresh cut grass.</prosody><break time="520ms"/><break time="120ms"/><prosody pitch="0.71st" rate="1.01">You can smell the coffee brewing at the nearby café, enticing you to grab a cup and enjoy the morning sunshine!</prosody><break time="520ms"/><break time="120ms"/><prosody pitch="-0.94st" rate="1.04">Of course, this is just fictional weather - if you want to know what the actual weather is like where you are, I recommend checking a reliable weather source!</prosody><break time="520ms"/><break time="120ms"/></speak>